(7688929, 1259786, 124190, '<td valign="top">The chess pieces are symmetric on the top half of your photo. The lighting plays around and through them.</td>', 'The chess pieces are symmetric on the top half of your photo. The lighting plays around and through them.', '2021-03-08 09:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7688930, 1259765, 124190, '<td valign="top">Yup. Straightforward symmetry and comment shows you understand what affects your capture.</td>', 'Yup. Straightforward symmetry and comment shows you understand what affects your capture.', '2021-03-08 09:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7688932, 1259476, 124190, '<td valign="top">Yup, there it is.</td>', 'Yup, there it is.', '2021-03-08 09:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7688933, 1259785, 124190, '<td valign="top">I''ve entered into observations of reflections in this challenge and wonder if your photo intends to represent the human figure as symmetric, which it can be, or if you chose to represent the reflection as symmetrical?  The photo is captivating.  I enjoy lingering here.</td>', 'I''ve entered into observations of reflections in this challenge and wonder if your photo intends to represent the human figure as symmetric, which it can be, or if you chose to represent the reflection as symmetrical?  The photo is captivating.  I enjoy lingering here.', '2021-03-08 09:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7688934, 1259791, 124190, '<td valign="top">Another reflection in the symmetry challenge.  I sound brutal because symmetry is defined as:<br/>the quality of being made up of exactly similar parts facing each other or around an axis.<br/>If you turn your photo sideways you will see the reflection of the hands being very different.  Picky,picky,picky....maybe, but this would score higher in a reflection challenge.</td>', 'Another reflection in the symmetry challenge.  I sound brutal because symmetry is defined as:the quality of being made up of exactly similar parts facing each other or around an axis.If you turn your photo sideways you will see the reflection of the hands being very different.  Picky,picky,picky....maybe, but this would score higher in a reflection challenge.', '2021-03-08 09:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7688935, 1259803, 124190, '<td valign="top">I especially appreciate that I was drawn in to inspect details in order to examine whether or not you mirrored the one piece, which it appears you did not. Two symmetric statues. Fits challenge well.</td>', 'I especially appreciate that I was drawn in to inspect details in order to examine whether or not you mirrored the one piece, which it appears you did not. Two symmetric statues. Fits challenge well.', '2021-03-08 09:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
