(7689498, 1259761, 30214, '<td valign="top">I was sure this would take the blue, much richer symmetry than a simple mirror symmetry in mine. Oh well, congrats on your ribbon anyway Girish!</td>', 'I was sure this would take the blue, much richer symmetry than a simple mirror symmetry in mine. Oh well, congrats on your ribbon anyway Girish!', '2021-03-15 00:16:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7689499, 1259437, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I figured this image would get short shrift, but I think it''s terrific.  Absolute, crystalline symmetry can be quite compelling, and many people must have expected such, as it is the challenge title, but allowing space to breathe is nice.  More approachable, relatable, interesting.  The front two ducks are actually quite close to the expected standard, but have the quickening of life to them.  Such beautiful grays, greens and yellows.  And the sense that what symmetry there is is momentary, a fortuitous snippet of choreography.  Most pleasing.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.  The 9.</td>', 'Yeah, I figured this image would get short shrift, but I think it''s terrific.  Absolute, crystalline symmetry can be quite compelling, and many people must have expected such, as it is the challenge title, but allowing space to breathe is nice.  More approachable, relatable, interesting.  The front two ducks are actually quite close to the expected standard, but have the quickening of life to them.  Such beautiful grays, greens and yellows.  And the sense that what symmetry there is is momentary, a fortuitous snippet of choreography.  Most pleasing.Personal favorite of the challenge.  The 9.', '2021-03-15 00:39:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7689500, 1259803, 97225, '<td valign="top">9 from me. This was my equal top pick with one other. I like the pieces and I like the processing.</td>', '9 from me. This was my equal top pick with one other. I like the pieces and I like the processing.', '2021-03-15 00:41:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7689501, 1259805, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love it - my only 10.  I know the symmetry isn''t perfect . . . you know the symmetry isn''t perfect.  But it''s the differences that hold my interest here.  Congratulations on the HM.</td>', 'I love it - my only 10.  I know the symmetry isn''t perfect . . . you know the symmetry isn''t perfect.  But it''s the differences that hold my interest here.  Congratulations on the HM.', '2021-03-15 00:46:05.000000', NULL, 0),
